OL,3,AParents of Southport attack victim
OL,4,A'devastated' by data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a child injured in the
OL,7,FSouthport attack have said they are
OL,8,F"devastated" after court files were
OL,9,Faccessed without authorisation.
OL,11,FThe Ministry of Justice (MoJ) said an
OL,12,Furgent investigation had been launched
OL,13,Fafter court files detailing victims,
OL,14,Ftheir families and survivors of the
OL,15,Fattack on the dance class in July 2024
OL,16,Fwere accessed without authorisation.
OL,18,FIt comes after it emerged earlier this
OL,19,Fyear that the North West Ambulance
OL,20,FService (NWAS) was looking into whether
OL,21,Fstaff inappropriately accessed the
OL,22,Frecords of victims.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
