OL,3,AParents of Southport attack victim
OL,4,A'devastated' by data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of one of the injured
OL,7,Fchildren said: "Our family has once
OL,8,Fagain been devastated by two data
OL,9,Fbreaches that involve our daughter,
OL,10,FNWAS and now the MoJ."
